# Public pages require no runtime credentials.
# Private review uses provider-managed private Blob credentials at runtime only.
# Pull credentials to an ignored mode-600 file outside web/ before local build.
# BLOB_STORE_ID= (OIDC-connected store, when supplied by the provider)
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN= (provider connection currently supplies this server-only token)
# Never use NEXT_PUBLIC for credentials or store the shared password in this file.
# The shared credential policy and private model manifest live in private Blob.
